  "description": "The Reaction Race represents the state of the art in aluminium hardtail frame construction. Light, strong efficient - that's the way we roll. It features double butted, mechanically formed aluminium tubes for efficient power transfer and accurate steering, backed up by the PressFit bottom bracket and tapered head tube with integrated sealed bearings. It boasts internal cable routing, so your gear shifts stay cleaner for longer, even in filthy trail conditions - and there's provision for a Stealth dropper post, too. And, with our Agile Ride Geometry, you can be sure of the inspirationally stable-but-lively ride quality for which all our bikes are justifiably famed.",
